 "changes_from_v1": [
  "src_cfbd is no longer one rights decision. Its per-lane policy lives in registry/lanes.v2.json and is enforced by football_src.source_lane_policy; the source row now sets lane_policy_required so a CFBD snapshot that names no lane sees nothing and trains nothing.",
  "src_cfbd display_policy widens to the widest any lane needs (public) and model_use_allowed to true. Neither is a loosening on its own: the lane narrows both, and a lane-less snapshot is refused.",
  "src_eada added: the US Department of Education Equity in Athletics dataset, one narrow lane.",
  "src_wikidata gains lanes so the college affiliation spine can carry its sampling bias as an enforceable model-use rule rather than a note."
 ],
